                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "n116",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "height": "fit_content",
                          "content": "I like getting hands-on, exploring different technologies, and pushing myself to understand more than I did yesterday. For me, engineering isn't just about writing code. It's about staying curious, learning continuously, and turning ideas into something useful.",
